            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Organic Restaurant Danang",
            "review_text": "Stanley H\nHong Kong, China11223 contributions\n1\nThe original seafood flavour of Zhejiang\nDec 2024 • Family\nThe day played a day under the rainy winds and the Panama mountain, and returned to the mountain foot, the rain finally stopped, and it was time for the team to eat dinner. This meal, the theme is seafood hot pot. However, we are here, a restaurant that is labeled with organic food. “Organic Hải Sản Vi Diệu” in Vietnamese, translated from Google to Chinese, is “organic delicious seafood”. And what we taste is the seafood stew pot from Hong Kong.\n\nFirst, the shop will take care of the wife's vegetarian meal. End out to her several large dishes, has shown the original color of the health food store. All pure vegetables combined, and healthy without oil, good for the wife's heart.\n\nAnd the other dishes, although they appear to be baked, but can be eaten by baking with water. Sweet roasted meat, which appears to be baked with water eggs and delicious spring rolls, are delicious enough.\n\nThen there was a seafood boat behind us. Seafood and vegetables are our main food. This is the proportion of three. As you can see, it is very rich.\n\nOperated by the shopkeepers, they first dropped eggs, shrimp, shrimp, etc. into the cage before steaming. Approximately 10 minutes. The shopkeeper came again. He opened the hot steaming furnace, and the smell of seafood immediately filled.\n\nThen the shopkeeper took the steamed seafood first. Also remove the steam. The rest is the fresh water left. The shop side adds a little hot soup, and immediately becomes a delicious hot pot soup. At this time, you should add pork sheets, crab, mushrooms and tofu, and boil something that can enhance the taste of the soup first.\n\nAfter cooking the first pot, you get a more delicious pot sauce. And this hot pot soup is used as the last food to cook. That's green rice.\n\nIt's all water boiling stuff. And this is more of a complete original taste food. Is it really Organic, I really don't know. But, this meal, absolutely rich seafood original flavour, feel no oil, less salt, all with the original taste of fish crab pork steamed and cooked. In terms of feeling, it is indeed \"eat completely healthy.\"\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Chinese\nShow original\nWritten May 28, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
