            "review_text": "Handi Suyadi\nBandung, Indonesia905 contributions\n0\nBig Portion\nApr 2024 • Family\n(Had lunch on April 15, 2024)\n\nThe menu I got were huge in term of portion. Vast array of steamed seafoods were steamed when I came. Then the same pan would be used for cooking hot pot. Akin to the first menu, there were a lot of seafoods and vegetables. Both of them had good quality and taste. Beside these, another menu with smaller portion also served, but still a lot.\n\nFor the dessert, the server gave one coconut pudding cup for one person. Don't ask more, as the restaurant limit only one cup per person.\n\nDuring lunch, occasionally a fly can be seen flew.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 30, 2025",
